ragraph","text":"ただ、せっせと動いてるだけでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬眠前のリス とか言われるの...( ･ิω･ิ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでぇぇー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ前にモバメでも、ふとしたときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんと手を繋いでる写真送ったことあったね（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、人見知りだけど、慣れるとすごい懐くタイプ。(　・´ｰ・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時、ひめたんの膝に手を置いてたら、ひめたんがその手を握ってきてくれたんだ( //^o^// )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、温泉が苦手らしいけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私とまりかとだけは、一緒に入ってくれる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46SHOW! 見てくれて有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、コント初登場で台詞はちょっとだったけど、参加できてすごく楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また出れたらいいなあー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の録音会、似顔絵会も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/11/5497285/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/11/5497285/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/11/5497285/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/02/11/5497285/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-h39828f19a9":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！橋本です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も公演でした！\n来てくださった皆さん、\n応援飛ばしてくださった皆さん、\nありがとうございました！(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残りの公演回数が三回になりました。\n思いや感想を先にここに書いてしまおうか悩みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり、最後の公演を終えるまで私は書きません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この公演は\n演じる部分とリアルの狭間にあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言ってしまえば、リアルも演出のうちです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はそのリアルを、舞台上でのみ表現します。\n舞台に向き合う私を観てください。\nそしてその舞台での私を評価してくれたら嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ、自分でハードル上げてしまった(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも追い込まなきゃ！\nこの公演を良い作品にしたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は直感を信じます！\nでは、今日もお疲れ様でした♪♪"}],"source":"archive"}}